B.a8Y=new A.a5(B.Fy,["\ud83d\udc4b Hi! I'm AdStick AI. Ask me about pricing, campaigns, driver earnings, GPS tracking, and more!","Hello! How can I help you today? Ask me about pricing, campaigns, driver earnings, GPS, or anything about AdStick.","Great question! Contact us at info@adstick.sa or tap the WhatsApp button. Available 9 AM\u20139 PM daily.","Ask me anything\u2026","AdStick AI","Online \xb7 Smart assistant","\ud83d\udcb3 Pricing","\ud83d\ude97 Earnings","\ud83d\udce2 Campaigns","\ud83d\udccd GPS","\ud83d\udcde Contact"],t.w)
